For any cyclic quadrilateral, opposite angles sum to 180°. Hence, ∠EGH + ∠EFG = 180°. Since ∠EFG = 60°, we find that ∠EGH = 120°. Finally, because ∠2 = ∠EHG and ∠EHG + ∠HGF = 90°, we conclude that ∠2 = 30°.

